{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X对人物为什么舍不得、为什么最终不回去的因果交代不如Y完整，尤其结尾没有明确写出即使一直等不到新的亲近关系，他也愿意好好生活。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点短句有明显加亮，感受又按音乐节点分批出现，边听边扫更容易抓住每段人物心理的核心变化，不必同时处理一整堆并列词语。更重要的是，X把旋律回返、舞步变化、摇篮曲破碎、祈祷转为意志以及最后的声音收束联系起来，音乐与人物情绪形成了连续的体验。Y的叙事因果更完整，人物为什么舍不得、为什么不敢回去交代得更充分，但右侧感受较像并列清单，音乐细节与情绪转折的对应不如X细腻。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "64a28921-74fc-489a-a63f-13e4acee60bb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T080209849415Z", "elapsed_seconds": 131.188, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T08:04:21.048838+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2a892655f0acfe29708f7fa7c903db4c154abd35b1c7a309065ab22b15789bd1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool